Version: 1.2.9
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ffmpeg, libgl1-mesa-glx, libegl1-mesa, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-randr0, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-xinerama0, libxcb-xfixes0, libxcb-shape0
Maintainer: AI Dubber Ultimate Team <support@aidubber.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/heng-dev/ai-dubber-ultimate
Description: AI-Powered Dubbing and Multi-Platform Video Processing Suite
 High-performance cross-platform dubbing software featuring FunASR,
 Demucs vocal separation, edge-tts, multi-engine translation, and video downloading.
 Heavy models and runtimes are dynamically downloaded on demand to the user's data directory.
